#: rc.cpp:35
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this if you do not want to display each instance of the same letter"
msgstr ""
"Selecioneo se non quere que se amosen todas a veces que aparece a mesma letra"

#. i18n: file advanced.ui line 86
#: rc.cpp:38
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you check this box, only the first letter will be written if the letter is "
"found in several places in the word. Then when you rechoose this letter, it "
"will replace the second instance in the word until there are no more instances "
"of this letter.\n"
"For example, the word to guess is \"potato\". If this option is unchecked, when "
"you try \"o\", the 2 \"o\" in the word will be discovered at the same time. If "
"this is checked, you will need to try \"o\" twice.\n"
"\n"
"Default is that for one letter typed, all instances of that letter in the word "
"are displayed."
msgstr ""
"Se selecciona está caixa, só se amosará a primeira vez que aparece unha "
"letra, ainda que se repita varias veces na mesma palabra. Se logo volve a "
"seleccionar esta letra, amosaranse todos os caracteteres ca conteñen.\n"
"\n"
"O comportamento normal é amosar todos os caracteres que conteñen a letra "
"cando a escribes."

